  "Question": "An opaque bag contains 3 white balls and 2 yellow balls, identical except for color. Draw 3 balls at once. Which of the following is a certain event?",
  "Choices": {
    "A": "All 3 balls drawn are white.",
    "B": "At least 1 of the balls drawn is white.",
    "C": "At least 1 of the balls drawn is yellow.",
    "D": "All 3 balls drawn are yellow."
  },
  "Correct Answer": "B",
  "Accepted Answers": [],
  "Unordered Answers": false,
  "Solution": "There are only 2 yellow balls, so drawing 3 balls must include at least 1 white ball. Thus, B is certain to occur; A and C may or may not occur, and D is impossible.",
